abstract: >-
  Evolution by Emergence is an open research corpus and machine-auditable
  candidate architecture for resource-constrained cumulative evolution. v21.1
  retains the v21 retained-organization/accessibility and cumulative-reproduction
  core, and extends the audited intelligent-system specialization with Step 6:
  common ground is the correction link rather than shared content.
keywords:
  - cumulative evolution
  - emergence
  - retained organization
  - accessibility
  - complex systems
  - Lean
  - corrigibility
  - common ground
  - SCAP
